notes.content:
This Kickstarter campaign main objective if to build the extended experience of Judgeball. Our game has been available in playtest for over a year now and players gave some crazy ideas. We enjoyed that so much that we really wanted to bring those into the game.

Go wild and join us in this crazy adventure that is Judgeball: [url=https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/wildbishop/judgeball-lethal-arena-a-handbrawl-game?ref=dcmcij]Judgeball's Kickstarter[/url]

Even though we have the money to finish the "base" game, we'd really like to let you guys get involved in the development of the extended experience of the game, which would include:
More champions ;
[list]
[*] More items ;
[*] A better ranked system ;
[*] New gameplay mechanics ;
[*] Cosmetics ;
[*] And much more...
[/list]

This Kickstarter is also a great opportunity for us to reach out to new players and develop this amazing community.

Every Kickstarter backer will get an opportunity to get involved in the development of the game. It can range from joining us on Discord... to creating every aspect of an upcoming champion with us!
